  "description": "A fictional South Korea that follows a constitutional monarchy.\n\nLabeled as evidence of infidelity, the youngest princess, Lee Shin-ah, gets caught up in the suicide of a student at the same school.\n\nWith the help of a newly appointed escort, Han Tae-kyung, she manages to clear her name, but continues to fall into an unknown conspiracy...\n\nMysterious enemies threatening the royal family, a sweet and bloody romance between Shin-ah and Tae-kyung that blossoms amidst the tension.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/59833617), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%82%98%EC%9D%98-%EB%A7%88%EC%A7%80%EB%A7%89-%EA%B3%B5%EC%A3%BC%EB%A5%BC-%EC%9C%84%ED%95%98%EC%97%AC/3348)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/120147)",
